{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X对人物心理变化的因果交代不如Y充分，容易抓住情绪变化，却不一定马上明白他为什么会这样想、这样做。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、重点高亮和较小的感受文字形成了清楚的主次，边听边扫时更容易抓住每段的核心；到时出现的提示又能把具体感受放回音乐发生的时刻。Y的优势是把人物的顾虑、心理转折和前后因果讲得更完整，整段故事更连贯，但长句需要持续阅读，而且压缩了不少音乐细节。综合来看，X更能兼顾即时阅读、段落重点和细腻的音乐感受，Y则胜在人物心理解释和叙事连贯性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8fa86928-5c79-4c70-8147-df7d965edc5f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T181434159212Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T18:15:52.273090+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "73a3b764f234a9b3a1c7ab5b3f08a9ec8b0d7d706944136ab13aa9b610b84af8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen